  "provenance": {
    "moogle_tables": "The shop has four selectable menu records and four pack sprite resources, with sentinel navigation IDs -1 and5 handled before indexing. Its three card-category descriptors contain explicit counts17,14,7 whose16-byte record arrays partition the exact contiguous native span. Each record uses the native script condition pointer and four probability weights. The random-value selector reads exactly ten weights totaling100. Floor table13x4x4 is bounded by the thirteen game floors and explicit inner loops; four pack types and four quality slots bound the4x4 price matrix. The five map-card category records include the special category4 referenced by map inspection. World-warp type selection wraps0..2 and therefore owns precisely three halfwords before the separate mode name, excluding two alignment bytes. Canonical structs retain actual native pointer fields; encoded resource and condition-script bytes remain assets."
